{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-bonding-hybridization","title":"碳的成键与杂化（Carbon Bonding and Hybridization）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/carbon-bonding-hybridization","wordCount":3174,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"碳的成键与杂化-carbon-bonding-and-hybridization\">碳的成键与杂化（Carbon Bonding and Hybridization）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>碳是有机化学的中心元素。在元素周期表中，碳位于第二周期第 IVA 族，基态电子构型为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1s^2 2s^2 2p^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，拥有四个价电子。这一特殊的电子结构使碳既不容易完全失去电子形成阳离子，也不容易获得四个电子形成阴离子，而是倾向于通过共享电子对形成共价键。更重要的是，碳—碳键的键能（约 346 kJ/mol）足够稳定，使碳原子能够彼此相连形成长链、支链、环状乃至笼状的分子骨架——这是其他元素难以企及的能力。</p>\n<p>本文将系统介绍碳的成键方式和三种杂化状态（sp³、sp²、sp），解析每种杂化对应的分子几何构型和键参数，并讨论杂化概念在理解有机分子结构中的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>杂化轨道理论</strong>（Hybridization Theory）是理解碳成键的中心模型：成键时，碳的一个 2s 轨道与若干 2p 轨道通过线性组合，生成一组能量相等、方向性更强的等价杂化轨道。杂化轨道的数目等于参与混合的原子轨道数目，其空间取向由电子对斥力（VSEPR）最小化决定。</p>\n<p>把握这一模型需要抓住三个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>s 成分决定碳的性质</strong>：s 成分越高（sp &gt; sp² &gt; sp³），杂化轨道越靠近原子核，碳的有效电负性越强、相连 C—H 的酸性越强、键长越短、键能越大。这条规律是贯穿全章的统一线索。</li>\n<li><strong>未杂化的 p 轨道负责 π 键</strong>：参与杂化后剩余的 p 轨道垂直于杂化轨道所在平面，彼此&quot;肩并肩&quot;重叠生成 π 键——这是双键、三键以及共轭体系的结构基础。</li>\n<li><strong>杂化是模型而非实体</strong>：杂化轨道无法被实验直接观测，它是对成键几何与能量的一种近似描述；更精确的成键图像由分子轨道理论给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：把杂化当作碳原子在成键之前就已真实完成的物理步骤。事实上，2s→2p 的激发本身是吸能的（约 400 kJ/mol），只有把它放进&quot;与配体成键的整体能量账&quot;里——杂化轨道方向性更强、形成的键更多更强——整个过程的净能量才是降低的。脱离成键谈&quot;杂化&quot;没有意义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;碳的杂化类型&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;sp³ 杂化&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;sp² 杂化&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;sp 杂化&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[&quot;4 个等价轨道, 25% s&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[&quot;四面体 109.5°&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[&quot;单键, 绕键轴可旋转&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[&quot;3 个等价轨道 + 1 个 p, 33% s&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[&quot;平面三角 120°&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[&quot;双键 = σ + π, 不可旋转&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[&quot;2 个等价轨道 + 2 个 p, 50% s&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[&quot;线形 180°&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[&quot;三键 = σ + 2π, 酸性最强&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"碳的杂化类型\"] --&gt; B[\"sp³ 杂化\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"sp² 杂化\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"sp 杂化\"]\n  B --&gt; B1[\"4 个等价轨道, 25% s\"]\n  B --&gt; B2[\"四面体 109.5°\"]\n  B --&gt; B3[\"单键, 绕键轴可旋转\"]\n  C --&gt; C1[\"3 个等价轨道 + 1 个 p, 33% s\"]\n  C --&gt; C2[\"平面三角 120°\"]\n  C --&gt; C3[\"双键 = σ + π, 不可旋转\"]\n  D --&gt; D1[\"2 个等价轨道 + 2 个 p, 50% s\"]\n  D --&gt; D2[\"线形 180°\"]\n  D --&gt; D3[\"三键 = σ + 2π, 酸性最强\"]</pre><h2 id=\"原子轨道与共价键形成\">原子轨道与共价键形成</h2><h3 id=\"碳的基态与激发态\">碳的基态与激发态</h3><p>碳的基态电子构型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1s^2 2s^2 2p^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显示只有两个未配对电子（分别在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2p_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2p_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 轨道），按此构型碳只能形成两个共价键。然而实验事实表明甲烷（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）中碳形成了四个等价的 C—H 键。为解释这一矛盾，Linus Pauling 于 1931 年提出了杂化轨道理论（Hybridization Theory）。</p>\n<p>杂化的物理本质是：当碳原子与其他原子成键时，一个 2s 电子被激发至空的 2p 轨道，然后 2s 与若干 2p 轨道通过线性组合（数学上的叠加）形成一组新的等价杂化轨道。这一过程需要投入能量（2s→2p 跃迁约 400 kJ/mol），但因杂化轨道的方向性更强，与配体形成的键更强、释放的键能更多，净能量是降低的——系统总体更稳定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"键与-键\">σ 键与 π 键</h3><p>有机分子中的共价键分为两种基本类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>σ 键（sigma bond）</strong>：两个原子轨道沿键轴方向&quot;头对头&quot;重叠形成，电子云沿键轴呈圆柱对称分布。σ 键是最稳定的共价键类型，允许绕键轴自由旋转。所有单键都是 σ 键。</li>\n<li><strong>π 键（pi bond）</strong>：两个 p 轨道平行&quot;肩并肩&quot;侧面重叠形成，电子云分布在键轴上下两侧的节面之间。π 键的重叠程度不如 σ 键，因此键能较低（C=C 中 π 键贡献约 264 kJ/mol vs σ 键贡献约 346 kJ/mol），且不允许自由旋转——这正是顺反异构（cis-trans isomerism）的结构基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>双键 = 1 个 σ 键 + 1 个 π 键；三键 = 1 个 σ 键 + 2 个 π 键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sp-杂化-四面体碳\">sp³ 杂化：四面体碳</h2><h3 id=\"杂化过程与轨道形态\">杂化过程与轨道形态</h3><p>在 sp³ 杂化中，碳的一个 2s 轨道与三个 2p 轨道混合，生成四个等价的 sp³ 杂化轨道。每个 sp³ 轨道含有 1/4 的 s 成分和 3/4 的 p 成分（25% s，75% p）。</p>\n<p>sp³ 轨道的空间分布指向正四面体的四个顶点，轨道间夹角为 109.5°。这一几何构型使四个键之间的电子对斥力（VSEPR 理论）最小化，是四配位碳最稳定的空间排列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"典型-sp-碳化合物\">典型 sp³ 碳化合物</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>化合物</th>\n<th>分子式</th>\n<th>键角</th>\n<th>C—H 键长</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲烷</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>109.5°</td>\n<td>1.09 Å</td>\n<td>完美四面体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乙烷</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~109.5°</td>\n<td>1.09 Å</td>\n<td>C—C 单键可旋转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环己烷</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~111°</td>\n<td>1.09 Å</td>\n<td>椅式构象最稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>甲烷是 sp³ 杂化的原型：四个 C—H 键完全等价，键角 109.5°，分子为正四面体结构。X 射线衍射和微波光谱实验精确证实了这一预测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sp-碳的特性\">sp³ 碳的特性</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>键长</strong>：C—C 单键 1.54 Å，C—H 键 1.09 Å</li>\n<li><strong>键能</strong>：C—C 约 346 kJ/mol，C—H 约 413 kJ/mol</li>\n<li><strong>旋转自由度</strong>：σ 键允许自由旋转，产生不同构象异构体</li>\n<li><strong>电负性效应</strong>：sp³ 碳的有效电负性约 2.5（Pauling 标度），因 s 成分最少</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sp-杂化-平面三角碳\">sp² 杂化：平面三角碳</h2><h3 id=\"杂化过程\">杂化过程</h3><p>在 sp² 杂化中，一个 2s 轨道与两个 2p 轨道混合，生成三个等价的 sp² 杂化轨道，剩余一个未杂化的 p 轨道垂直于三个 sp² 轨道所在平面。每个 sp² 轨道含 33% s 成分和 67% p 成分。</p>\n<p>三个 sp² 轨道指向平面三角形的三个顶点，彼此间夹角 120°。未参与杂化的 p 轨道垂直于该平面，用于形成 π 键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"乙烯中的双键\">乙烯中的双键</h3><p>乙烯（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）是 sp² 杂化的典型实例。每个碳用三个 sp² 轨道分别与两个氢原子和另一个碳原子形成 σ 键，两个碳上各剩一个未杂化 p 轨道平行重叠形成一个 π 键。最终形成 C=C 双键（一个 σ + 一个 π）。</p>\n<p>乙烯的关键参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>C=C 键长：1.34 Å（短于 C—C 的 1.54 Å）</li>\n<li>C=C 键能：约 614 kJ/mol（σ 约 350 + π 约 264）</li>\n<li>H—C—H 键角：约 117°（略小于理想 120°，因 C=C 的 π 电子云排斥）</li>\n<li>分子为完全平面结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因 π 键的存在，C=C 双键不允许自由旋转。若要绕双键旋转，必须先断裂 π 键（需约 264 kJ/mol），这在常温下不会自发发生——这就解释了为什么烯烃存在顺反异构体。</p>\n<h3 id=\"共轭与离域\">共轭与离域</h3><p>当多个 sp² 碳相邻排列时，相邻的 p 轨道可以形成连续重叠的 π 体系，称为共轭（Conjugation）。在共轭体系中，π 电子不再局限于两个碳原子之间，而是在整个共轭链上离域（Delocalization）。</p>\n<p>1,3-丁二烯（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>=CH—CH=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_2\\text{=CH—CH=CH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=CH—CH=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）是最简单的共轭二烯。其中间 C—C 键的键长为 1.48 Å（介于典型单键 1.54 Å 和双键 1.34 Å 之间），说明 π 电子确实发生了离域。共轭效应使分子整体更稳定——1,3-丁二烯比两个孤立乙烯分子加氢时多释放约 16 kJ/mol 的能量，这一额外稳定化能称为共轭稳定化能（Conjugation Stabilization Energy）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sp-杂化-线性碳\">sp 杂化：线性碳</h2><h3 id=\"杂化过程\">杂化过程</h3><p>在 sp 杂化中，一个 2s 轨道与一个 2p 轨道混合，生成两个等价的 sp 杂化轨道，剩余两个未杂化的 p 轨道互相垂直且都垂直于 sp 轨道轴线。每个 sp 轨道含 50% s 成分和 50% p 成分。</p>\n<p>两个 sp 轨道方向相反，形成 180° 的线形排列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"乙炔中的三键\">乙炔中的三键</h3><p>乙炔（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）中，每个碳用两个 sp 轨道分别与一个氢原子和另一个碳原子形成 σ 键，两对未杂化 p 轨道形成两个相互垂直的 π 键。C≡C 三键 = 1σ + 2π。</p>\n<p>乙炔的参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>C≡C 键长：1.20 Å（最短的 C—C 键）</li>\n<li>C≡C 键能：约 839 kJ/mol</li>\n<li>分子为完全线性，键角 180°</li>\n<li>C—H 键长：1.06 Å（短于 sp³ C—H 的 1.09 Å，因 s 成分更高）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sp-碳的特殊性质\">sp 碳的特殊性质</h3><p>sp 杂化碳的 s 成分最高（50%），导致几个重要推论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>电负性最高</strong>：s 轨道更靠近原子核，电子被束缚更紧。sp 碳有效电负性约 3.3，高于 sp² 碳（~2.9）和 sp³ 碳（~2.5）。这使炔烃末端氢具有弱酸性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pK</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pK}_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pK</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ≈ 25）。</li>\n<li><strong>键长最短</strong>：C—H 键 1.06 Å（sp）&lt; 1.08 Å（sp²）&lt; 1.09 Å（sp³）。</li>\n<li><strong>键能最大</strong>：s 成分越高，σ 键越强。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"杂化与分子性质的关联\">杂化与分子性质的关联</h2><h3 id=\"杂化对酸性的影响\">杂化对酸性的影响</h3><p>碳原子杂化状态直接影响相连氢原子的酸性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pK</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sp</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mtext>sp</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>44</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mtext>sp</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pK}_a: \\text{C}_2\\text{H}_2 (\\text{sp}, 25) &lt; \\text{C}_2\\text{H}_4 (\\text{sp}^2, 44) &lt; \\text{C}_2\\text{H}_6 (\\text{sp}^3, 50)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pK</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sp</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>解释：sp 碳的 s 成分最高，形成的 C—H 键中电子对更靠近碳原子，碳负离子的孤对电子占据 s 成分更高的轨道，更稳定——因此脱质子更容易。这一规律在有机合成中有重要应用：末端炔烃可被强碱（如 NaNH₂）脱质子形成炔基负离子，作为亲核试剂参与碳链延长反应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"杂化与键的极性\">杂化与键的极性</h3><p>不同杂化碳的有效电负性差异还会影响 C—C 键的极性。例如在丙烯（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>—CH=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_3\\text{—CH=CH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—CH=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）中，sp³ 碳与 sp² 碳之间的 C—C 键存在微弱极性（δ⁺ 在 sp³ 端，δ⁻ 在 sp² 端），因为 sp² 碳的电负性略高。这种微小的极性差异在某些反应中起到导向作用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"杂化参数总结\">杂化参数总结</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杂化类型</th>\n<th>s 成分</th>\n<th>p 成分</th>\n<th>轨道数</th>\n<th>几何构型</th>\n<th>键角</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sp³</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>四面体</td>\n<td>109.5°</td>\n<td>甲烷、乙烷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sp²</td>\n<td>33%</td>\n<td>67%</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>平面三角</td>\n<td>120°</td>\n<td>乙烯、苯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sp</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>线形</td>\n<td>180°</td>\n<td>乙炔、CO₂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用与延伸\">实际应用与延伸</h2><h3 id=\"材料科学中的杂化\">材料科学中的杂化</h3><p>杂化概念在材料科学中有直接应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>金刚石</strong>：每个碳原子 sp³ 杂化，形成三维四面体网络。这种结构赋予金刚石极高的硬度（莫氏硬度 10）、宽禁带（5.5 eV）和优异的导热性（~2200 W/m·K）。</li>\n<li><strong>石墨</strong>：每个碳原子 sp² 杂化，形成平面六元环层状结构。层内 C—C 键极强（共轭 π 体系），层间仅靠 van der Waals 力连接，因此石墨柔软可层剥。离域 π 电子使石墨在层内方向具有导电性。</li>\n<li><strong>石墨烯</strong>：单层石墨，2004 年由 Andre Geim 和 Konstantin Novoselov 首次分离（2010 年诺贝尔物理学奖），具有超高电子迁移率和力学强度。</li>\n<li><strong>富勒烯与碳纳米管</strong>：sp² 碳的弯曲变体，引入五元环产生曲率，展现独特的电子和光学性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"药物分子中的杂化识别\">药物分子中的杂化识别</h3><p>在药物化学中，识别分子中碳原子的杂化状态是理解药物-受体相互作用的基础。例如阿司匹林（乙酰水杨酸）分子中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>苯环上的碳：sp² 杂化（芳香共轭）</li>\n<li>酯键的羰基碳：sp² 杂化</li>\n<li>甲基碳：sp³ 杂化</li>\n<li>羧基碳：sp² 杂化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不同杂化碳的几何构型决定了分子的整体三维形状，进而影响其与酶活性位点的匹配程度——这是药物设计中&quot;锁钥模型&quot;的结构化学基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>碳的杂化理论是有机化学的第一块基石。通过 sp³、sp²、sp 三种杂化方式，碳原子能够构建四面体、平面和线形三种基本几何构型。杂化类型决定了键角、键长、键能等基本参数，进而影响分子的酸碱性、极性、刚柔性和反应活性。在后续章节中，官能团的反应性和立体化学现象都可以追溯到碳原子的杂化状态——这一概念将贯穿有机化学的始终。</p>\n<p>掌握杂化理论的关键在于：记住 s 成分越高 → 电负性越强 → 键长越短 → 键能越大 → 酸性越强。这条规律是理解有机化学中众多现象的统一线索。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碳的成键与杂化（Carbon Bonding and Hybridization）","id":"碳的成键与杂化-carbon-bonding-and-hybridization"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原子轨道与共价键形成","id":"原子轨道与共价键形成"},{"level":3,"text":"碳的基态与激发态","id":"碳的基态与激发态"},{"level":3,"text":"σ 键与 π 键","id":"键与-键"},{"level":2,"text":"sp³ 杂化：四面体碳","id":"sp-杂化-四面体碳"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化过程与轨道形态","id":"杂化过程与轨道形态"},{"level":3,"text":"典型 sp³ 碳化合物","id":"典型-sp-碳化合物"},{"level":3,"text":"sp³ 碳的特性","id":"sp-碳的特性"},{"level":2,"text":"sp² 杂化：平面三角碳","id":"sp-杂化-平面三角碳"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化过程","id":"杂化过程"},{"level":3,"text":"乙烯中的双键","id":"乙烯中的双键"},{"level":3,"text":"共轭与离域","id":"共轭与离域"},{"level":2,"text":"sp 杂化：线性碳","id":"sp-杂化-线性碳"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化过程","id":"杂化过程"},{"level":3,"text":"乙炔中的三键","id":"乙炔中的三键"},{"level":3,"text":"sp 碳的特殊性质","id":"sp-碳的特殊性质"},{"level":2,"text":"杂化与分子性质的关联","id":"杂化与分子性质的关联"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化对酸性的影响","id":"杂化对酸性的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化与键的极性","id":"杂化与键的极性"},{"level":3,"text":"杂化参数总结","id":"杂化参数总结"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用与延伸","id":"实际应用与延伸"},{"level":3,"text":"材料科学中的杂化","id":"材料科学中的杂化"},{"level":3,"text":"药物分子中的杂化识别","id":"药物分子中的杂化识别"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"官能团分类与命名（Functional Groups: Classification and Nomenclature）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/functional-groups"}}